WEBVTT

00:00:00.126 --> 00:00:05.523
A rose-scented birthday.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.971
It's Annie's ribbon.

00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:19.692
Lightly tied to the barn,
there was Annie's ribbon.

00:00:20.111 --> 00:00:26.189
It was a seal of friendship for two girls
who grew up together like sisters.

00:00:37.182 --> 00:00:39.162
Good night, Candy.

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:43.856
God, please take care after me,
Annie Brighton, and Candice White.

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:47.755
Let us always be happy.

00:01:08.044 --> 00:01:10.480
Slept well!

00:01:10.581 --> 00:01:11.673
Huh?

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.377
What a nice smell!
Is it Annie's ribbon?

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.022
It's not it!

00:01:28.303 --> 00:01:30.149
Roses!

00:01:30.309 --> 00:01:31.632
Anthony!

00:01:38.369 --> 00:01:40.440
Anthony must have brought
them here!

00:01:44.689 --> 00:01:47.956
I slept sound and didn't hear anything...

00:01:48.311 --> 00:01:52.438
Oh, no! Anthony must have seen
me in an embarrassing pose!

00:01:52.473 --> 00:01:53.713
What'll I do?

00:01:56.639 --> 00:01:59.405
She won't even notice if I turn
this into a prank.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.812
Look, some are missing!

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:15.713
Anthony, does it matter if one
or two got stolen?

00:02:15.748 --> 00:02:17.336
So many are blooming now!

00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:20.987
But whoever came in here must
have known what he was doing!

00:02:21.144 --> 00:02:25.621
That's right! He knew that I'm protecting
these roses more than anything else.

00:02:25.656 --> 00:02:28.881
Hey, Anthony, maybe you picked them
yourself and then forgot about it?

00:02:28.922 --> 00:02:33.658
I wouldn't do such a violent thing!
Roses are living creatures, too!

00:02:34.461 --> 00:02:37.254
-Hey, brother!
-What is it, Archie?

00:02:37.313 --> 00:02:40.428
Don't tell me that you took these
roses as a present for Candy!

00:02:40.855 --> 00:02:45.028
Archie, just why would I want to
take these to Candy?

00:02:45.063 --> 00:02:48.971
If I'd give someting to her, then it
would've been one of my inventions!

00:02:49.006 --> 00:02:49.781
But...!

00:02:50.022 --> 00:02:54.136
Archie! How many times
have I told you!

00:02:54.253 --> 00:02:56.288
Now you're getting upset
over this! Suspicious!

00:02:56.323 --> 00:02:57.441
What?

00:02:57.592 --> 00:03:01.629
Stop that! I don't think
either one of you did this!

00:03:01.872 --> 00:03:03.169
Of course!

00:03:03.547 --> 00:03:07.136
But I won't forgive the one
who did this to my roses.

00:03:11.071 --> 00:03:13.140
Good day, Anthony.

00:03:15.454 --> 00:03:17.287
Look what the cat brought in.

00:03:22.382 --> 00:03:25.568
-You look surprised.
-What did you want, Eliza?

00:03:25.938 --> 00:03:30.653
I made this tasty pie and I thought
I'd take it to Anthony.

00:03:30.688 --> 00:03:32.609
We've got some things to do.

00:03:32.644 --> 00:03:33.685
Let's go, Stear.

00:03:33.844 --> 00:03:35.949
We'll be at Candy's place.

00:03:37.878 --> 00:03:40.283
Anthony, let's go to your room.

00:03:40.318 --> 00:03:42.459
I'm not in the mood for pie.

00:03:42.734 --> 00:03:46.655
Are you saying that you won't eat
this because Candy didn't make it?

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.442
Anyway, I don't want to eat it.

00:03:48.902 --> 00:03:51.775
Anthony? You like Candy that much?

00:03:52.621 --> 00:03:54.340
Stop saying things like that!

00:03:54.469 --> 00:03:56.802
That's right! Candy isn't
just someone to toy around with!

00:03:56.837 --> 00:04:02.199
Are you saying that you
didn't bring those roses to Candy?

00:04:02.974 --> 00:04:05.263
Eliza? Candy has roses...?

00:04:05.298 --> 00:04:09.071
Yes. I thought that it was you who
brought them to her in the barn...

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.014
Candy has...

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.797
Anthony, I'm sure Candy didn't
mean any harm.

00:04:17.832 --> 00:04:20.095
She probably took them because they're
so pretty. Right, Archie?

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.863
Yeah. I'll tell her about this.

00:04:22.898 --> 00:04:24.292
I'll tell her too.

00:04:24.521 --> 00:04:25.662
Candy has...

00:04:30.634 --> 00:04:35.597
What? I'm surprised that
it wasn't a present from Anthony!

00:04:37.559 --> 00:04:40.437
Come to think of it, Candy can't tell the
difference between her own things and things

00:04:40.438 --> 00:04:43.621
...of other people. So you'd better be
careful when she's around.

00:04:58.268 --> 00:04:59.295
Stear!

00:05:00.174 --> 00:05:01.902
I've been looking for you!
Hop in!

00:05:12.217 --> 00:05:15.848
What? Then, Anthony wasn't
the one who brought those roses?

00:05:15.883 --> 00:05:18.350
I thought that it would be the
best to apologize now.

00:05:18.385 --> 00:05:22.317
Because Anthony is pretty mad at the
person who took his roses.

00:05:22.352 --> 00:05:25.204
Stear! Even you think I did it?

00:05:25.239 --> 00:05:26.515
But.. nobody else...

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.584
Go over to Anthony! I'll join you later!

00:05:29.619 --> 00:05:30.600
Candy! Wait!

00:05:30.635 --> 00:05:32.631
Wha.. the car...

00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:35.327
Candy! B-but my car...
Wait!

00:05:47.523 --> 00:05:48.788
Good morning, Dorothy.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.189
I've been looking for you!
Neil!

00:05:53.103 --> 00:05:55.477
What is it, Candy?

00:05:55.512 --> 00:05:57.634
You're having your breakfast pretty
early today.

00:05:57.669 --> 00:05:58.749
Mind your own business.

00:05:59.104 --> 00:06:01.593
Yesterday you went to bed pretty late.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:04.527
Does that have anything to do with you?

00:06:04.937 --> 00:06:05.707
Neil?

00:06:12.167 --> 00:06:15.196
-Show me your hand, Neil!
-What are you doing?

00:06:15.211 --> 00:06:15.943
Show me!

00:06:15.978 --> 00:06:16.765
Let me go!

00:06:21.346 --> 00:06:24.151
I said, show me your hand!
Just what is this wound?

00:06:24.186 --> 00:06:25.756
You got this from rose thorns,
didn't you?

00:06:25.791 --> 00:06:27.719
I don't know!
Let me go!

00:06:27.934 --> 00:06:30.599
You stole Anthony's roses
during the night, didn't you?

00:06:31.031 --> 00:06:32.748
You're hurting me!

00:06:34.269 --> 00:06:35.290
Candy!

00:06:36.526 --> 00:06:37.203
Yes?

00:06:38.426 --> 00:06:41.207
Mother! Candy is being mean
to me again!

00:06:41.415 --> 00:06:43.384
I'm not! Neil has...

00:06:43.788 --> 00:06:48.654
That's enough! I wonder just
who is responsible for this mess!

00:06:52.209 --> 00:06:55.359
You say something to her and
she goes crazy in a second.

00:06:57.136 --> 00:07:00.739
What are you looking?
The carpet is getting soaked!

00:07:01.149 --> 00:07:02.404
Yes!

00:07:03.602 --> 00:07:04.747
I'll help you.

00:07:04.782 --> 00:07:07.410
Candy, you stay here.
I want to talk to you.

00:07:07.721 --> 00:07:10.495
Before that, there's something
I'd like to show you.

00:07:10.662 --> 00:07:12.198
Something to show me?

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:13.718
Yes.

00:07:19.805 --> 00:07:24.262
You're saying that Neil stole
these roses from Anthony's garden?

00:07:24.343 --> 00:07:27.229
There is a wound from rose thorns
on Neil's hand.

00:07:28.587 --> 00:07:30.716
Neil! Show me your hand.

00:07:33.068 --> 00:07:33.939
Neil!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.982
Explain how you got this wound!

00:07:41.373 --> 00:07:42.799
It's...

00:07:43.298 --> 00:07:44.342
Neil!

00:07:46.956 --> 00:07:49.898
Neil, be a man and tell the truth.

00:07:49.939 --> 00:07:52.793
Candy, you be quiet!
Neil!

00:07:56.568 --> 00:08:00.850
It's from a cat! I got this while playing
with Sylvia. Is that right, Sylvia?

00:08:04.637 --> 00:08:08.012
Neil, you haven't mentioned the
cat until now!

00:08:12.412 --> 00:08:15.746
That's right, it does look a bit
like a cat's scratch.

00:08:16.093 --> 00:08:17.507
Neil, you liar!

00:08:21.333 --> 00:08:25.197
Huh? Isn't this the ribbon that
got stolen from Annie the other day?

00:08:25.198 --> 00:08:26.276
That's...

00:08:27.144 --> 00:08:30.436
Candy? You'd steal our guest's
ribbon?

00:08:30.857 --> 00:08:35.234
She stole it! She even stole these roses
and now she's trying to put the blame on me!

00:08:35.367 --> 00:08:36.620
Neil!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.425
Candy, explain how you got this ribbon!

00:08:39.829 --> 00:08:40.843
It's...

00:08:41.107 --> 00:08:43.048
No wonder she doesn't want to tell!

00:08:44.123 --> 00:08:50.504
I mustn't tell them. Annie will be hurt
if they find out that she is my friend.

00:08:52.027 --> 00:08:53.188
Hey, Candy!

00:08:54.352 --> 00:08:56.209
What is it, a cat ate your tongue?

00:08:58.545 --> 00:09:01.083
She's trying to fool us by crying!

00:09:01.287 --> 00:09:03.331
Candy, what is it then?

00:09:03.436 --> 00:09:06.150
I haven't stolen anything!

00:09:09.048 --> 00:09:10.832
Wait!
Candy!

00:09:19.902 --> 00:09:23.138
How far will they go?
How unfair will they get?

00:09:27.736 --> 00:09:30.235
I mustn't cry. I must not
give in to tears.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:32.592
I mustn't cry. Don't cry, Candy!

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:42.368
Anthony.

00:09:47.761 --> 00:09:51.644
If I tell this to Anthony,
I'm sure he will understand.

00:10:13.716 --> 00:10:14.751
How did it go?

00:10:15.957 --> 00:10:18.225
He said that he doesn't want
to see you right now.

00:10:20.157 --> 00:10:21.322
Anthony...?

00:10:21.508 --> 00:10:23.127
Anthony said that?

00:10:30.993 --> 00:10:33.630
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
I see you complaining back there, you, yeah, you,
SHUT UP. I may or may not be doing my best here!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.328
Even Anthony has doubts in me.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:50.127
What am I supposed to do at
a time like this, Annie?

00:10:50.637 --> 00:10:52.119
I want to see you, Annie.

00:10:56.571 --> 00:10:59.792
I wonder where does this river
lead to.

00:11:00.149 --> 00:11:03.878
If I take on this boat, will
it take me back to Pony's home?

00:11:13.599 --> 00:11:15.284
Candy has disappeared?

00:11:15.319 --> 00:11:18.235
She looked strange last time I saw her,

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:20.373
...she left Leagan's estate but
never came back!

00:11:20.558 --> 00:11:22.387
Isn't she somewhere around here?

00:11:22.448 --> 00:11:24.918
I heard this from Leagans themselves.

00:11:27.965 --> 00:11:30.524
She isn't back yet?

00:11:30.547 --> 00:11:31.914
Eliza!

00:11:31.949 --> 00:11:33.633
She might not come back at all!

00:11:33.821 --> 00:11:38.728
Because we found out that she stole
Annie's ribbon and Anthony's roses.

00:11:42.924 --> 00:11:45.740
They said it wasn't their problem.

00:11:46.431 --> 00:11:48.324
Stear, I'm going to look for her.

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.661
I got it now, Anthony!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.372
I know who stole your roses!

00:11:54.788 --> 00:11:56.028
Really, Archie?

00:11:57.248 --> 00:12:01.288
I saw him leave this place
during the night!

00:12:07.181 --> 00:12:09.098
I don't know! I don't know!

00:12:09.684 --> 00:12:11.471
I don't know anything!

00:12:11.488 --> 00:12:12.342
Neil!

00:12:12.894 --> 00:12:15.397
I don't know anything!

00:12:16.524 --> 00:12:17.406
Wait, Neil!

00:12:18.112 --> 00:12:19.698
What's up with this wound?

00:12:19.733 --> 00:12:21.514
A cat did that!

00:12:21.549 --> 00:12:22.778
Let him go, Anthony.

00:12:22.992 --> 00:12:26.250
Neil, this is a lie detector
I built myself.

00:12:26.285 --> 00:12:28.825
If you tell a lie, this
lamp will go off!

00:12:29.229 --> 00:12:30.913
I don't know anything!

00:12:31.124 --> 00:12:32.650
No!

00:12:35.989 --> 00:12:37.642
I knew it, you're lying!

00:12:38.232 --> 00:12:39.180
Anthony...

00:12:39.215 --> 00:12:40.375
Well, Neil?

00:12:40.979 --> 00:12:43.520
I snuck in here during the night...

00:12:43.766 --> 00:12:46.085
And then you made it look like
Candy did it?

00:12:47.966 --> 00:12:49.073
Idiot!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:53.263
Stear, Archie, let's find Candy
before it gets dark.

00:12:53.335 --> 00:12:54.391
Ok!

00:12:54.426 --> 00:12:55.092
Let's go!

00:13:15.775 --> 00:13:17.826
Candy, it's dangerous!

00:13:17.861 --> 00:13:19.548
It's okay, Annie!

00:13:20.555 --> 00:13:22.748
Annie is worrying so much.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.720
It's dangerous!

00:13:24.755 --> 00:13:26.745
You're a coward, Annie!

00:13:28.897 --> 00:13:31.285
Look out, Candy!

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.702
Candy!

00:13:35.812 --> 00:13:38.216
I must have fallen asleep.

00:13:43.097 --> 00:13:45.472
Oh no! The boat is moving
pretty fast!

00:13:50.641 --> 00:13:53.502
This is bad. I think that
the flow is getting faster.

00:13:53.537 --> 00:13:54.902
And there is no oar!

00:14:02.878 --> 00:14:04.259
What's that sound?

00:14:10.083 --> 00:14:13.020
Candy!

00:14:13.721 --> 00:14:15.824
Candy!

00:14:15.914 --> 00:14:19.633
Candy, where are you?

00:14:19.903 --> 00:14:21.901
She probably isn't around here.

00:14:22.063 --> 00:14:23.429
Let's go this way.

00:14:28.923 --> 00:14:29.841
Let's go!

00:14:30.301 --> 00:14:32.446
Wait up!
I'll give you some light.

00:14:32.563 --> 00:14:35.127
This lie detector is a biggest
lie in itself!

00:14:35.162 --> 00:14:36.492
It's a Stear illumination device!

00:14:36.527 --> 00:14:38.107
Let's go, we have to find Candy!

00:14:50.457 --> 00:14:52.730
It's the sound of a waterfall!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.697
Help me!

00:15:00.904 --> 00:15:03.334
Help me, somebody!

00:15:03.956 --> 00:15:06.176
Candy!

00:15:06.191 --> 00:15:09.548
-Candy!
-Candy!

00:15:11.055 --> 00:15:13.194
Help me!

00:15:17.443 --> 00:15:19.870
-Candy!
-Candy!

00:15:26.999 --> 00:15:30.920
-The boat is gone.
-Maybe Candy took it?

00:15:30.955 --> 00:15:34.800
This is bad! If she went downstream,
the river will take her to the waterfall!

00:15:34.926 --> 00:15:36.343
Candy...

00:15:37.985 --> 00:15:39.278
Help!

00:15:39.861 --> 00:15:41.525
Help me, Annie!

00:15:41.623 --> 00:15:43.454
Anthony!

00:15:50.649 --> 00:15:52.688
-Candy!
-Candy!

00:15:52.723 --> 00:15:54.065
Candy!

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:57.171
Candy, where are you?

00:16:12.278 --> 00:16:14.025
This girl...

00:16:47.049 --> 00:16:49.173
What happened to me?

00:16:49.712 --> 00:16:50.816
Are you awake?

00:16:58.381 --> 00:17:02.635
Hey, I saved your life, and you
thank me by flopping over again?

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.232
Is my face really that scary?

00:17:10.492 --> 00:17:12.962
There it is! The waterfall!

00:17:13.448 --> 00:17:14.426
Let's hurry, Anthony!

00:17:19.899 --> 00:17:23.362
-You're a funny old guy!
-You're a merry one, too.

00:17:25.574 --> 00:17:26.606
It's tasty.

00:17:26.641 --> 00:17:29.603
Hadn't I pulled you from the
water beneath the waterfall,

00:17:29.638 --> 00:17:30.807
...you'd be in heaven right now.

00:17:30.842 --> 00:17:31.950
Thank you.

00:17:32.348 --> 00:17:34.901
Mister, you look much prettier
without your sunglasses on!

00:17:34.994 --> 00:17:39.539
Light hurts my eyes.
And besides, I'm hardly a "mister" yet!

00:17:39.746 --> 00:17:41.496
Sorry.

00:17:41.531 --> 00:17:42.857
I'm Albert.

00:17:42.878 --> 00:17:44.104
Mr. Albert?

00:17:44.487 --> 00:17:46.013
Candy!

00:17:46.048 --> 00:17:47.706
Candy!

00:17:47.914 --> 00:17:49.711
That voice, it's Anthony!

00:17:51.558 --> 00:17:54.025
Candy, where are you?

00:17:55.677 --> 00:17:57.262
Anthony is calling me...

00:17:57.644 --> 00:17:59.674
Candy!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.463
Anthony!

00:18:01.949 --> 00:18:03.846
Looks like he's here to help you.

00:18:04.222 --> 00:18:06.710
Anthony, I'm here!

00:18:07.122 --> 00:18:08.760
Anthony!

00:18:08.787 --> 00:18:10.317
Anthony!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.750
Let's go!

00:18:15.438 --> 00:18:19.216
Candy, if something bad ever happens to you,
you can write me a letter.

00:18:19.251 --> 00:18:24.039
Put it in a bottle and allow southern winds to
take it. Your note will surely reach me.

00:18:24.683 --> 00:18:26.504
Thank you, mr. Albert.

00:18:26.539 --> 00:18:27.885
Okay.

00:18:27.981 --> 00:18:31.115
Candy! Where are you?

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.760
Anthony!
I'm here!

00:18:36.012 --> 00:18:37.462
Anthony!

00:18:37.874 --> 00:18:38.671
Candy.

00:18:39.066 --> 00:18:40.762
Anthony!

00:18:40.951 --> 00:18:43.658
Candy, why are you in such a place?

00:18:44.066 --> 00:18:48.161
The boat almost took me to heaven.

00:18:50.673 --> 00:18:52.163
Don't joke with me!

00:18:52.555 --> 00:18:53.738
Anthony!

00:18:54.555 --> 00:18:57.471
Did you think just how
worried everybody was?

00:18:57.865 --> 00:18:59.944
I'm sorry.

00:19:00.091 --> 00:19:03.516
I was so sad when you didn't want to
see me...

00:19:03.894 --> 00:19:07.915
It wasn't because I thought
you stole those roses.

00:19:07.916 --> 00:19:09.091
Then...?

00:19:09.523 --> 00:19:14.789
I didn't want to see you until a
new kind of rose bloomed in my garden.

00:19:14.824 --> 00:19:16.195
New kind of rose?

00:19:16.322 --> 00:19:19.038
That's right. Remember what I
promised you on that day?

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:31.721
Candy, next time we meet,
it will be your birthday.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:41.216
I wanted to give you this
new rose for your birthday.

00:19:41.251 --> 00:19:44.323
But because they haven't bloomed yet,
I couldn't have met you.

00:19:44.453 --> 00:19:47.206
So that's how it was.
And I was so...

00:19:47.241 --> 00:19:48.736
Is someone else here?

00:19:48.842 --> 00:19:51.898
Yes. A man who saved me, mr. Albert.

00:19:51.933 --> 00:19:53.174
Mr. Albert?

00:19:57.637 --> 00:19:58.932
Mr. Albert?

00:19:59.778 --> 00:20:00.993
He disappeared!

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:03.469
-Anthony!
-Anthony!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.138
-Candy!
-You're okay, Candy!

00:20:07.285 --> 00:20:08.822
Alright! Let's go back!

00:20:10.478 --> 00:20:12.460
-Now, come on, Candy.
-Okay.

00:20:13.224 --> 00:20:15.088
Let's go!

00:20:16.093 --> 00:20:17.448
Wait up, Anthony!

00:20:17.483 --> 00:20:18.930
-Anthony!
-Candy!

00:20:46.546 --> 00:20:49.500
It's blooming.
The new rose is blooming.

00:20:52.325 --> 00:20:54.977
Beautiful!
This is a new rose, right?

00:20:55.012 --> 00:20:55.936
How do you call it?

00:20:56.365 --> 00:20:57.611
Sweet Candy.

00:20:57.646 --> 00:20:59.033
Sweet Candy?

00:20:59.068 --> 00:21:04.279
I will give it to you as a present.
And today is your new birthday.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.924
Thank you, Anthony.

00:21:08.151 --> 00:21:14.941
As the morning light shone upon it,
Candy admired the Sweet Candy rose.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.000
To be continued...
